hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2705","Narrated to us Muhammad ibn Yahya, narrated to us Muslim ibn Ibrahim, narrated to us Qaz‘ah, narrated to me Suwayd ibn Hujayr, narrated to us al-Muhājir ibn ‘Ikrimah who said:\n\nWe asked Jābir ibn ‘Abd Allāh (RA) about a man who completes his prayer and his tawāf, then exits the mosque and faces the House (the Ka‘bah). He said, “I did not think anyone would do this except the Jews.”\n\n**CHAPTER:**"
